plaso.tsv: what plaso (the log2timeline/plaso:20260720 Docker image) reads
from tests/fixtures/plaso/skype_main.db (gunzipped) with its sqlite/skype
plugin (psort -a -o json_line), one line per event, written by plaso_tsv.py
(its docstring and FIELDS list the columns). Written from plaso's output,
not from this crate.

The input layout, on a host with Docker:

    /tmp/sbx/skype/in/skype_main.db

The commands:

    sudo docker run --rm -v /tmp/sbx/skype:/data log2timeline/plaso:20260720 log2timeline --status_view none -q --parsers 'sqlite/skype' --storage-file /data/out.plaso /data/in
    sudo docker run --rm -v /tmp/sbx/skype:/data log2timeline/plaso:20260720 psort --status_view none -q -a -o json_line -w /data/out.jsonl /data/out.plaso
    python3 -I tests/oracle/plaso_tsv.py out.jsonl > tests/oracle/plaso.tsv
